    <!-- Section 4: Technical Risk Focus & Syllabus -->
    <section class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-start">
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-orange-700 block">Kurikulum Pembinaan Resmi Kemnaker RI</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-serif font-extrabold text-slate-900">Materi Inti Pelatihan &amp; Evaluasi Teknis Boiler</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
          Kurikulum memadukan ketentuan peraturan perundangan K3 uap Indonesia dengan praktik pengoperasian sehari-hari pada boiler bahan bakar solid (cangkang/fiber/batubara), gas, maupun minyak residu.
        </p>

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-base mb-1">1. Peraturan Perundang-undangan Pesawat Uap &amp; Pengawasan K3</h3>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              UU No. 1/1970, Undang-Undang Uap 1930, Peraturan Uap 1930, serta klasifikasi bejana bertekanan dan kewajiban Akte Izin Pesawat Uap serta prosedur pemeriksaan berkala (riksa uji).
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-base mb-1">2. Konstruksi Ketel Uap (Fire Tube, Water Tube &amp; Thermal Oil)</h3>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              Mengenal komponen ruang bakar (furnace), superheater, economizer, air preheater, sootblower, sistem draft udara (FD/ID Fan), hingga pembuangan abu.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-base mb-1">3. Apendages (Perlengkapan Pengaman Wajib Boiler)</h3>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              Fungsi dan pengecekan rutin dua gelas penduga, tingkap pengaman (safety valve), manometer dengan strip merah tekanan maksimum, keran cabang tiga, peluit tanda bahaya rendah air, dan keran penguras (blowdown valve).
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-base mb-1">4. Pengolahan Air Umpan Boiler (Boiler Water Treatment)</h3>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              Pengendalian kesadahan (hardness), silika, pH, TDS, oksigen terlarut, dosis bahan kimia anti-kerak &amp; anti-korosi, serta teknik continuous &amp; intermittent blowdown untuk mencegah pipa pecah (tube rupture).
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-base mb-1">5. Prosedur Start-Up, Normal Running, Shutdown &amp; Tanggap Darurat</h3>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              Tahapan pemanasan lambat (slow firing), sinkronisasi uap ke header/turbin, deteksi carryover atau priming, serta prosedur darurat ketika level air hilang dari gelas penduga.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

